OL,3,A'Thuggish' behaviour could see
OL,4,Abalaclava ban in more cities
OL,5,
OL,6,FBalaclavas could be banned in more city
OL,7,Fcentres over concerns about "thuggish"
OL,8,Fbehaviour, including robberies,
OL,9,Fburglaries and drug dealing.
OL,11,FThe social media hashtag "no face no
OL,12,Fcase" has been gaining traction
OL,13,Fglorifying balaclavas as a way to avoid
OL,14,Fprosecution.
OL,16,FPolice across the UK have said face
OL,17,Fcoverings are hampering their efforts
OL,18,Fto identify potential offenders.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
