OL,3,A'Thuggish' behaviour could see
OL,4,Abalaclava ban in more cities
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials in Newport, as well as,
OL,7,FCoventry, Stafford and Wolverhampton,
OL,8,Fare exploring ways to strengthen
OL,9,Fexisting powers to challenge those
OL,10,Fwearing balaclavas, while Nottingham
OL,11,Fhas already introduced a ban.
